Date of completion/withdrawal/discontinuation* :date
Study participation outcome* $study_participation_outcome :radio_buttons [1=Completed,2=Withdrawn,3=Discontinued] {condition_target=reason_for_withdrawaldiscontin,condition_action=show,condition_test=2;3}
Reason for withdrawal/discontinuation* $reason_for_withdrawaldiscontin :checkboxes {dictionary=withdis_reason,condition_target=other_reason,condition_test=O,condition_action=show}
Other reason* $other_reason :text